# Trivy ignore list for pg-volume-backup.
#
# Temporary suppressions for CVEs whose fixed packages are not yet available
# in the configured AL2023 repositories.
#
# Re-validate and remove each entry after its fixed package is available and
# adopted by the image build.
#
# All entries below verified against a fresh Trivy/Grype/Scout scan on
# 2026-10-28 against aws-backup-base:1.2.2 (AL2023 digest
# sha256:c04a1012...be9b6). Confirmed via `dnf list --showduplicates <pkg>`
# that no build matching the "Fixed Version" the scanners report exists yet
# in the AL2023 repository mirror. These mirror the same unfixed set
# documented in aws-backup-base's own .trivyignore/SECURITY.md; suppression
# is a scan-time parameter, not inherited from the base image, so it must be
# maintained here too.
#
# All previously-listed entries (gnutls, the old misattributed-libcap Go
# stdlib set, supercronic Go stdlib CVE-2026-42504, libsolv,
# postgresql15/postgresql15-private-libs, openssl-fips-provider-latest/
# openssl-libs, glib2, libacl, the old cpython configparser/tarfile/
# unicodedata/BZ2 set) are resolved: the AL2023 digest refresh and `dnf
# upgrade` already pull PostgreSQL 15.19-1.amzn2023.0.1, and bumping the
# supercronic/docker-cli builder images to golang:1.27.3-alpine (removing
# the GOTOOLCHAIN=go1.27.1 pin that silently froze the compiled Go stdlib)
# resolved the Go stdlib findings on both binaries. Removed accordingly.

# ca-certificates: Firefox website spoofing via failure to block
# compromised intermediate certificates — fix: 2025.2.76-1.0.amzn2023.0.4
# (not yet in repo)
CVE-2026-113470

# curl-minimal / libcurl-minimal / curl: HTTP/2 upload Use-After-Free —
# fix: 8.21.0-5.amzn2023.0.3 (not yet in repo)
CVE-2026-92392

# cyrus-sasl-lib / cyrus-sasl: heap buffer overflow in add_to_challenge()
# allows malicious server to crash client — fix: 2.1.27-18.amzn2023.0.4
# (not yet in repo)
CVE-2026-107161

# libcap: upstream Go net/http advisories misattributed by Trivy's AL2023
# feed to this package's NVR — fix: 2.73-1.amzn2023.0.8 (not yet in repo)
CVE-2026-78659
CVE-2026-78667
CVE-2026-94440

# pcre2 / pcre2-syntax: out-of-bounds write/read via crafted regular
# expressions and invalid UTF matching — fix: 10.40-1.amzn2023.0.5 (not
# yet in repo)
CVE-2026-103111
CVE-2026-86145
CVE-2026-89156
CVE-2026-89160

# python3 / python3-libs: certificate verification bypass via missing
# server_hostname validation in SSLContext.wrap_bio() — fix:
# 3.9.25-1.amzn2023.0.11 (not yet in repo)
CVE-2026-19553
